Package: FishHist
Type: Package
Title: Processing for Southeast Fisheries Management History data
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Who wrote it
Maintainer: The package maintainer <sarina.atkinson@noaa.gov>
Description: Federal Register (FR) notices offer vital snapshots of individual fisheries management actions, however, they remain fragmented on their own. To build a continuous regulatory timeline, the Southeast Fisheries Management History dataset was processed to bridge the gaps between notices. This processed dataset is called fishhist. Additional functions take the processed dataset and produce standard tables, plots, or analysis-ready data frames.
Imports: ggplot2, dplyr, flextable, lubridate, purrr, stringr, tibble, tidyr, stats
License: What license is it under?
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
URL: https://github.com/SEFSC/FishHist, https://supreme-broccoli-2mkenmw.pages.github.io/
BugReports: https://github.com/SEFSC/FishHist/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
